\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Shares hit new year high,  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  off peaks\b0\par\par\uc2 660 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Oktober 2009\par 13:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Emerging shares hit new 2009 high\par \par \uc2 * Russian rouble advances to new 2009 high\par \par \uc2 * Hungary's forint backs off after hitting nine-month highs\par \par \uc2 By Sebastian Tong\par \par \uc2 LONDON, Oct 20 (Reuters) - Emerging shares rose on Tuesday in tandem with their global peers to hit new 2009 highs boosted by robust corporate earnings and resurgent commodity prices, while Russia's rouble scaled fresh peaks against its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket even as the dollar slid to a 14-month low.\par \par \uc2 Several emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  backed off from recent multi-month gains, including Hungary's forint, which eased after rising to nine-month highs versus the euro <EURHUF=>.\par \par \uc2 Helping to set the buoyant market mood were forecast-busting quarterly earnings from computing giant \uc2 Apple Inc\uc2  whose record sales numbers for its iPhones and iMacs suggested the return of U.S. consumption. [ID:nN19395089]\par \par \uc2 The dollar's weakness <.DXY> is also driving investors to higher-yielding emerging markets, where the pace of economic recovery is quickening.\par \par \uc2 The magnitude of investment flows into Brazil prompted the country to unveil on Monday plans for a capital inflows tax. [ID:nN19264977]\par \par \uc2 Fellow emerging giant Russia said an exit from the recession was in sight while a Chinese vice-premier said China's economy was growing faster with every month. [ID:nPEK195317] [ID:nLK281969]\par \par \uc2 The benchmark emerging equities index <.MSCIEF> firmed 0.3 percent to 980.16 by 1045 GMT, its highest level since August 2008, while emerging sovereign debt spreads <11EMJ> were flat to trade 302 bps over U.S. Treasuries.\par \par \uc2 "Emerging markets have been very strong for the last few days, it would take quite a bit of a negative event to break or reverse that trend," said Beat Siegenthaler, chief strategist emerging markets at \uc2 TD Securities\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The news from Brazil...implies the government is becoming increasingly nervous about \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength," \uc2 TD Securities\uc2 ' Siegenthaler said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  OFF PEAKS\par \par \uc2 Polish shares <.WIG20> advanced to a new 12-month high while Israeli equities <.TA25> continued to hover at their highest levels in 15 months.\par \par \uc2 Russian <.IRTS> and South Africa <.JTOPI> shares stayed aloft at 13-month peaks, buoyed by a commodities rally which saw oil <CLc1> peeking above $80 a barrel and gold rising close to last week's record highs <XAU=>.\par \par \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allowed the rouble <RUS=MCX> to climb to a new 2009 high against its dollar-euro basket, a move that analysts said confirmed Moscow's intention to move towards a free floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . [ID:nLK333254]\par \par \uc2 Most emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, were off recent highs.\par \par \uc2 The Israeli shekel <ILS=> backed off from 10-month peaks versus the dollar it reached on Monday, when its strength was said to have sparked \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . [ID:nLJ81201]\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's zloty softened a touch to the euro <EURPLN=> after an over one-percent gain in the previous day. A Polish monetary policymaker was quoted in a newspaper on Tuesday arguing that the country's interest rate should not be raised for the next six to seven months.\par \par \uc2 The policymaker is one of the nine of the ten members in the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monetary Policy Council to be replaced early next year. [ID:nLK292958]\par \par \uc2 Hungary's forint <EURHUF=> also eased after touching a nine-month high against the euro earlier in the day on its \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  head's comments that the scope for further rate cuts was limited. [ID:nLJ68323]\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Iceland's parliament is mulling an amended bill to repay Britain and the Netherlands more than $5 billion in deposits lost in the island state's financial meltdown. [ID:nLJ220595]\par \par \uc2 The passing of the bill would pave the way for a release of a $10 billion aid package led by the IMF. (Additional reporting by Carolyn Cohn; Editing by Andy Bruce)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-EMERGING|LANGEN|C|D|E|M|O|U|MTL|GRO|SOF|OIL|RBN|Z|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091023e5ak00132\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
