\par\par \b \uc2 Poland - Factors to Watch on June 4\b0\par\par\uc2 374 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 2009\par 08:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  WARSAW, June 4 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Poland's financial markets on Wednesday. ALL TIMES GMT (Poland GMT + 2 hours):\par \par \uc2  RATES\par \par \uc2  Poland's fiscal policy will play an important part in upcoming rate decisions, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor said on Thursday.                                    [ID:nWAR008406]\par \par \uc2  DEPOSITS\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's financial authority does not plan to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the aggressive deposit battle waged in the banking sector, one of its officials tells Parkiet.\par \par \uc2  WARSAW BOURSE\par \par \uc2  A delay in the sale of a controlling stake in the Warsaw bourse could be delayed beyond this year, a deputy treasury minister tells Rzeczpospolita.\par \par \uc2  PM ON BUDGET\par \par \uc2  The government does not want to drastically increase the budget deficit when it revises in next month, Prime Minister Donald Tusk said in a radio interview. \par \par \uc2  EURO PATH\par \par \uc2  Polish ERM-2 entry in the second half of year may not be beneficial for the country's economy, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Jan Czekaj is quoted as saying by Rzeczpospolita.        [nL4286859]\par \par \uc2  AGORA\par \par \uc2  Polish publisher Agora  could pay out a dividend of at least 27.5 million zlotys ($8.8 million) from 2008 profit, said chief fund manager at Agora's largest financial investor, BZ WBK AIB Asset Management.                     [ID:nL3362026]\par \par \uc2  TVN\par \par \uc2 Moody's\uc2  credit agency downgraded the outlook of the Polish media group TVN  to negative from stable, but left its rating unchanged at Ba3, the company said in a statement late on Wednesday.                                      [ID:nL3367292]\par \par \uc2  MILLENNIUM\par \par \uc2  Polish bank Millennium  received a 200 million euros credit line from its parent bank, Portugal's \uc2 Millennium bcp\uc2  , for general financing.            [ID:nL3166026]\par \par \uc2  NOTE - For a diary of forthcoming events see [PL/DIARY] and a calendar of east European economic indicators see [CONV/DIARY].\par \par \uc2    For other related news, double click on: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Polish equities       [PL-E]     E.Europe equities     [.CEE]\par  Polish money          [PL-M]     Polish debt           [PL-D]\par  Eastern Europe        [EEU]      All emerging markets  [EMRG]\par  Hot stocks            [HOT]      Stock markets         [STX]\par  Market debt news      [DBT]      \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news            [FRX]\par  \par  For real-time index quotes, double click on:\par  Warsaw WIG20 <.WIG20>  Budapest BUX <.BUX>  Prague PX <.PX>\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 LANGEN|Table|ABN|E|RBN|PX|M|D|REVU|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090604e564000c8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
