\par\par \b \uc2 DJ UPDATE:Polish Ctrl Bk Pres:Mulling Small  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Transactions\b0\par\par\uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2009\par 14:07\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2009, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 (Adds earlier comments by a member of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monetary Policy Council on possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    WARSAW (Dow Jones)--\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Poland\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is considering entering the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market with very small transactions to develop a better understanding of the market's dynamics and participants, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  President Slawomir Skrzypek said Thursday. \f28 \par \par \uc2 "These transactions would be much too small to have an effect on the zloty exchange rate," Skrzypek said.\par \par \uc2 Skrzypek's comments coincide with remarks by a member of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monetary Policy Council, or the RPP, Dariusz Filar, earlier in the day.\par \par \uc2 In an interview with the daily Rzeczpospolita released Thursday, Filar reiterated that a significant rebound in inflation, partly resulting from the weak zloty, would make the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market "justified."\par \par \uc2 "And that's what we said in the statement after the RPP's latest meeting," Filar said, adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has all the necessary tools to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and that "right now it's up to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dealers to decide when to enter the market."\par \par \uc2 -By David McQuaid and Malgorzata Halaba; Dow Jones Newswires, +4822 528 6787; malgorzata.halaba@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 March 05, 2009 08:07 ET (13:07 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020090821e5350mami\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
