ghtly above a record low. (Reporting by Kuba Jaworowski and Pawel Florkiewicz, editing by Stephen Nisbet)\par \par \uc2 POLAND-RATES/FILAR (URGENT, INTERVIEW))|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|PX   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090220e52h001j3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
