\par\par \b \uc2 Polish Ctrl Bk's Kozinski: Against  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Unless CPI Risk\b0\par\par\uc2 168 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Februar 2009\par 13:09\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WARSAW (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  shouldn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the zloty until its depreciation begins to pose an inflation risk, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy President Witold Kozinski said Monday.\par \par \uc2 Kozinski, who supervised the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's "managed float" \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime in the mid-1990s, stirred controversy in early 2008 when he said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the strengthening of the now free-floating zloty.\par \par \uc2 "Just as I favored \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when we had an appreciating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , I now oppose \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the zloty is depreciating - at least until that depreciation starts to pose an inflationary threat," Kozinski told journalists at a news briefing.\par \par \uc2 Kozinski's comments came amid a renewed bout of global risk aversion that sent the zloty plunging 4% against the euro Monday, to a new five-year low of PLN4.8270.\par \par \uc2 -By Marynia Kruk; Dow Jones Newswires; +4822 528-6776; david.mcquaid@dowjones.com [ 16-02-09 1226GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020090216e52g000kc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
