\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Polish Ctrl Bk Head: No  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  On  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  For Now\b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 2009\par 08:41\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WARSAW (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's president Slawomir Skrzypek reiterated Thursday that there's no need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stop the zloty's slide.\par \par \uc2 Speaking in a live interview for Radio Zet, Skrzypek said that any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  talk or discussion about what zloty level would trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  "would weaken the zloty even further."\par \par \uc2 However, Skrzypek said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has all the necessary tools to defend the zloty if and when needed, such as foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves.\par \par \uc2 He added that under current conditions, joining the Exchange Rate Mechanism ERM2 "would encourage more speculation on the zloty." He said joining ERM2 "would trigger constant \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market."\par \par \uc2 "I don't think that euro adoption is a cure for everything," Skrzypek said.\par \par \uc2 The Polish government aims to adopt the euro in 2012. That would mean it has to be euro-ready in 2011 and has to join the EMR2 mechanism by the mid-2009.\par \par \uc2 Skrzypek also said the weak zloty doesn't mean the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's easing policy cycle is over.\par \par \uc2 "I can't rule out more rate cuts," Skrzypek said.\par 