s," Skrzypek said.\par \par \uc2 In January, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monetary Policy Council cut key rates by 75 basis points, to 4.25%.\par \par \uc2 -By Malgorzata Halaba; Dow Jones Newswires, +4822 528 6787; malgorzata.halaba@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 February 05, 2009 02:41 ET (07:41 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020090820e5250m9hh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
