\par\par \b \uc2 Polish c.banker opposes zloty  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 -paper\b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 2008\par 11:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WARSAW, July 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the soaring zloty, which reached new all-time highs against the euro this week, a Monetary Policy Council member was quoted as saying on Saturday.\par \par \uc2 The zloty has gained nearly a third in value since Poland joined the European Union in 2004, squeezing exporters and prompting calls from some politicians and businessmen for moves to cool down the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It reached a record of 3.3120 to the euro in thin trade on Friday on expectations of further rate hikes and a strong economy. Other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have also been hitting all-time highs versus the common \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The experiences of other countries shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are costly and do not bring desired effects," MPC member Halina Wasilewska-Trenkner told business daily Parkiet. "I am of the opinion that the zloty exchange should shape itself freely."\par \par \uc2 The former finance minister added that any changes to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime are outside the scope of the MPC and even the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and would require the government's backing.\par \par \uc2 Several MPC members have spoken out against \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In March, Prime Minister Donald Tusk said he would not back a nomminee for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy governor after he spooked the markets by suggesting he may back \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to tame the vibrant zloty. (Reporting by Chris Borowski, Editing by Peter Blackburn)\par \par \uc2 POLAND-ZLOTY/|LANGEN|ABN|M|PX|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080705e4750005f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
