\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Polish Ctrl Bkr Noga: 2 More Rate Hikes Needed In 08   \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Februar 2008\par 10:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (Adds detail, comments.) \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 WARSAW (Dow Jones)--Poland needs two more rate hikes in 2008, to 5.75%, Marian Noga, a member of Polish \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's Monetary Policy Council, or RPP, said Tuesday.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Speaking in a live interview for TVN CNBC Biznes, Noga said that timing of the next decision will depend on the new CPI projection due late February.   \par \par \uc2 "Inflationary pressure remains," Noga said. "High economic growth results in all kinds of instabilities."   \par \par \uc2 The RPP still faces the question of what level of interest rate is needed "to bring inflation down to the 2.5% target" and "to anchor it" at this level, Noga added.   \par \par \uc2 The key interest rate level is 5.75%, Noga said.   \par \par \uc2 In January, the RPP hiked the key rate to 5.25%, from 5.00%.   \par \par \uc2 Noga didn't give the timing of the future rate hikes, but said that "to prevent an inflation rise is less costly," than to fight high inflation.   \par \par \uc2 He added that there is no need for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and that such an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be necessary only if "the inflation target is threatened".   \par \par \uc2 Noga referred to last week's statement made by Witold Kozinski, a candidate for deputy president of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be necessary if the zloty exchange rate threatens exports.   \par \par \uc2 -By Malgorzata Halaba; Dow Jones Newswires; +482-2-622-2767; malgorzata.halaba@dowjones.com [ 12-02-08 0904GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080212e42c000le\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
