\par\par \b \uc2 Polish MPC's Filar - No need for  \highlight22\uc2 fx intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 127 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Februar 2008\par 10:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 WARSAW, Feb 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as long as the strong zloty helps limit price growth and meet the bank's inflation target, Monetary Policy Council member Dariusz Filar said on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 "If a strong zloty helps limit inflation, there is no justification for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Filar told Reuters. "At the moment, there isn't any."   \par \par \uc2 He was commenting on suggestions by would-be deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, Witold Kozinski, that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be used to slow the zloty's advance because it hurt exporters.   \par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Pawel Florkiewicz, writing by Marynia Kruk)   \par \par \uc2 POLAND-CBANK/ FILAR (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|PX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080208e4280015z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
