\par\par \b \uc2 Polish Ctrl Bk Pres: Says Opposes  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  On  \highlight22\uc2 Fx \highlight\uc2  Market   \b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 2007\par 15:21\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WARSAW (Dow Jones)--Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Slawomir Skrzypek said Monday he opposes \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets except under exceptional circumstances.   \par \par \uc2 "I am staunch opponent of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , even though it's a policy instrument like any other," Skrzypek told a business gathering in Warsaw. [ 24-09-07 1340GMT ]   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president explained that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  "make sense when they are to counteract changes in the exchange rate that are not due to economic fundamentals, but to other factors."   \par \par \uc2 Skrzypek cited the actions of Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  during Argentina's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis of 2001-2002. He said it was an example of justifiable \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at preventing the spill-over of a regional crisis from damaging Chile's sound economic fundamentals.   \par \par \uc2 Monday's statement marks the fullest elaboration of Skrzypek's personal views on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since he took the reins at the National Bank of Poland in January.   \par \par \uc2 Skrzypek's economic views weren't well known prior to his appointment because he had made his career in public administration and business, and thus had no monetary policy track record.   \par \par \uc2 -By David McQuaid, Dow Jones Newswires; +4822 622-2766; david.mcquaid@dowjones.com [ 24-09-07 1414GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070924e39o000ts\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
