\par\par \b \uc2 Poland - Factors to Watch on May 19  \b0\par\par\uc2 526 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Mai 2006\par 08:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 WARSAW, May 19 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Poland's financial markets on Friday. ALL TIMES GMT (\b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  GMT + 2 hours):  \par \par \uc2 NO \b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's government has not exchanged any funds on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market this year and has no plans to do so, a deputy finance minister said, denying financial market rumours. ID:nL18482659]  \par \par \uc2 OUTPUT/PPI  \par \par \uc2 The Central Statistical Office is due to publish Polish industrial output and PPI figures for April at 1200 GMT. According to a Reuters poll industrial output is expected to rise 9.3 percent year-on-year while PPI is to rise 0.9 percent.  \par \par \uc2 TAX REFORMS  \par \par \uc2 The ruling conservatives are becoming anxious to see at least part of the tax reforms proposed by Finance Minister Zyta Gilowska, reports daily Rzeczpospolita, adding that her plans may run into trouble with new government partners.  \par \par \uc2 MUNIBOND BOOM  \par \par \uc2 Polish municipalities issued 12.6 percent more debt in the first quarter of 2006 than in the same period of last year, boosting January-March issuance to 3.5 billion zlotys ($1.13 billion), Rzeczpospolita reports.  \par \par \uc2 STATE FIRMS  \par \par \uc2 Bourse daily Parkiet writes that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Treasury Ministry\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to speed up management changes in state-owned companies including listed metals maker KGHM , fuel group PKN ORLEN and chemical firm Police .  \par \par \uc2 T-BILL TENDER  \par \par \uc2 Poland sets final offer value for Monday's tender of 1.0-1.3 billion zlotys of 52-week treasury bills.  \par \par \uc2 INDIAN TRADE MINISTER  \par \par \uc2 Poland's Economy Minister Piotr Wozniak and India's Trade Minister Kamal Nath hold a briefing on economic cooperation, 0945.  \par \par \uc2 POLISH-GERMAN GAS  \par \par \uc2 German President Horst Koehler said on Thursday he hoped that Germany and Poland would find a solution to a conflict over a Russian-German gas pipeline project which strained their relations.[ID:nL18712345]  \par \par \uc2 GRAINS  \par \par \uc2 Polish farmers and grain traders have offered a total of 847,000 tonnes of grain to the European Union's stocks so far, the state Farm Market Agency (ARR) said. [ID:nL18707688]  \par \par \uc2 PUBLIC TV  \par \par \uc2 Poland's public television has appointed its new management board, writes daily Gazeta Wyborcza. which includes a member of the radical nationalist youth organisation affiliated with new government coalition member League of Polish Families.  \par \par \uc2 WINTERTHUR BLOCKED  \par \par \uc2 The Polish pension funds regulator rejected Credit Suisse insurance arm Winterthur's bid to take over a small local pension fund, the regulator said in a statement on Thursday, citing procedural reasons. [ID:nL18708180]  \par \par \uc2 News editor of the day: Wojciech Moskwa +48 22 653 9709  \par \par \uc2 NOTE - For a diary of forthcoming events see [PL/DIARY] and a calendar of east European economic indicators see [CONV/DIARY].  \par \par \uc2 For other related news, double click on:   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Polish equities       [PL-E]     E.Europe equities     [.CEE]\par  Polish money          [PL-M]     Polish debt           [PL-D]\par  Eastern Europe        [EEU]      All emerging markets  [EMRG]\par  Hot stocks            [HOT]      Stock markets         [STX]\par  Market debt news      [DBT]      \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news            [FRX]\par  \par  For real-time index quotes, double click on:\par  Warsaw WIG20 <.WIG20>  Budapest BUX <.BUX>  Prague PX <.PX>\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ($1=3.087 Zloty)  \f28 \par \par \uc2 LANGEN|Table|ABN|E|RBN|PX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060519e25j000vh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
